        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f9aad0a0-8f58-3fed-805b-d49f79382f56",
                "word": "как-нибудь",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f10e7d10-0cf3-3667-9348-bea3ac9b7dd0",
                        "entry_id": "f9aad0a0-8f58-3fed-805b-d49f79382f56",
                        "glosses": [
                            "каким бы то ни было образом, способом; так или иначе"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d0922b2-9366-4199-835d-1790ccb7f0fa",
                                "sense_id": "f10e7d10-0cf3-3667-9348-bea3ac9b7dd0",
                                "text": "Была, кроме того, у меня ещё и другая мысль, что без меня ещё жена как-нибудь устроится, а со мной всё равно ей надо пропадать."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "330dd457-e01a-3f8c-9260-e4aa0a1fbd9a",
                        "entry_id": "f9aad0a0-8f58-3fed-805b-d49f79382f56",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. недостаточно хорошо, кое-как, небрежно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "69d2e373-2c09-438d-8db3-58d1d353d1e2",
                                "sense_id": "330dd457-e01a-3f8c-9260-e4aa0a1fbd9a",
                                "text": "Мы все учились понемногу // Чему-нибудь и как-нибудь, // Так воспитаньем, слава богу, // У нас немудрено блеснуть."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b2b46fb8-8e45-3060-902d-decc3e686a30",
                        "entry_id": "f9aad0a0-8f58-3fed-805b-d49f79382f56",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. когда-нибудь, как только найдётся время"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a07860c8-5cb6-425d-84c1-b14670ba9b70",
                                "sense_id": "b2b46fb8-8e45-3060-902d-decc3e686a30",
                                "text": "— Ужо заходи как-нибудь вечерком, — говорила Привалову Марья Степановна, когда он уходил."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e3ec5500-d121-462d-9d68-e1f74979e32e",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9aad0a0-8f58-3fed-805b-d49f79382f56",
                        "source_sense_description": "так или иначе",
                        "target_lang_word": "anyhow",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anyhow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "516bb592-5a7f-3ac5-8ce9-7913813a4967",
                                        "entry_id": "b59486c2-62d5-39ec-a382-2a408194a083",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In any way or manner whatever."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83f427f9-5ba3-31f0-85dd-8e6488553f3b",
                                        "entry_id": "b59486c2-62d5-39ec-a382-2a408194a083",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In any case. Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "847d6881-4be4-4052-bf5a-e9038f139002",
                                                "sense_id": "83f427f9-5ba3-31f0-85dd-8e6488553f3b",
                                                "text": "Anyhow, he is dead now."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b977d98b-e64d-401e-a33c-5b0317efedcf",
                                                "sense_id": "83f427f9-5ba3-31f0-85dd-8e6488553f3b",
                                                "text": "I think they’re asleep; anyhow, they’re quiet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0940a240-1ee8-31f5-98f9-732c20d2e030",
                                        "entry_id": "b59486c2-62d5-39ec-a382-2a408194a083",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without care or tidiness; recklessly, negligently or randomly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "087e4759-0431-4e12-879f-0c1e72e37d94",
                                                "sense_id": "0940a240-1ee8-31f5-98f9-732c20d2e030",
                                                "text": "It was a woman’s clothing, beyond a doubt, all thrown in anyhow, — as if the person who had placed it there had been in a desperate hurry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6f9d7d0-facd-353b-92c4-b6069ec9f54d",
                                        "entry_id": "b59486c2-62d5-39ec-a382-2a408194a083",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Thoughtlessly, randomly, without careful consideration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Singapore",
                                            "Singlish",
                                            "broadly",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "anyhow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4fe65b5-8313-3cdb-b4b8-853a0ebd9049",
                                        "entry_id": "5f7b4bb6-2c74-3b52-8b75-e06f6d4d5659",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Random, careless, offhand, disorderly; done without thought or consideration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Singapore",
                                            "Singlish",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "predicative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a61365b-129d-46bb-be37-36d8ae9f8052",
                                                "sense_id": "b4fe65b5-8313-3cdb-b4b8-853a0ebd9049",
                                                "text": "Rabak, to refer to something messed up: Eh bro, your hairdresser anyhow sia, your hair damn rabak."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60374265-b52b-4d57-b0f6-1597a31edfbb",
                                                "sense_id": "b4fe65b5-8313-3cdb-b4b8-853a0ebd9049",
                                                "text": "Even the newspaper recommendation oso anyhow one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c1246bc-cb6d-428a-bd43-53eb193d8512",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9aad0a0-8f58-3fed-805b-d49f79382f56",
                        "source_sense_description": "так или иначе",
                        "target_lang_word": "anyway",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anyway",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "624e8085-dc54-3de9-8cb7-ad48ea71c66d",
                                        "entry_id": "ccd67228-325c-304e-80b6-0187c9512dac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Regardless; anyhow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f68e5d33-bd50-425e-9ce7-f8fd5ae95f88",
                                                "sense_id": "624e8085-dc54-3de9-8cb7-ad48ea71c66d",
                                                "text": "He didn't enjoy washing his car, but it was so dirty that he did it anyway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3963f60-b255-4b57-b1c3-2acb6069e309",
                                                "sense_id": "624e8085-dc54-3de9-8cb7-ad48ea71c66d",
                                                "text": "Raymond Carver had only moments late at night to write after grueling day jobs, tense relationships, putting kids to bed, and dealing with his own alcoholism. And he wrote anyway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a96c8d4-d45f-3937-b84d-55451e27e6ea",
                                        "entry_id": "ccd67228-325c-304e-80b6-0187c9512dac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See anyhow and at least."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c696683-8c5f-4694-9d43-15e4778dd3af",
                                                "sense_id": "4a96c8d4-d45f-3937-b84d-55451e27e6ea",
                                                "text": "I don't think that's true. I haven't found any evidence, anyway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "352438d5-acfa-4ba0-adae-e69023ff619a",
                                                "sense_id": "4a96c8d4-d45f-3937-b84d-55451e27e6ea",
                                                "text": "But I wish there were somethin’ you would do or say\nTo try and make me change my mind and stay\nWe never did too much talkin’ anyway\nDon’t think twice, it’s all right."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ef4644b-5caf-3353-aceb-ba8b7e78d3de",
                                        "entry_id": "ccd67228-325c-304e-80b6-0187c9512dac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to indicate a change of subject."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa6b4851-64b8-4e21-90d4-3d445866fccc",
                                                "sense_id": "4ef4644b-5caf-3353-aceb-ba8b7e78d3de",
                                                "text": "\"I'll be ninety my next birthday, but Louella doesn't tell her age. Anyway, we're going to have you and Cynthia up for supper.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c6fa63c-7c76-35a8-abad-644040b4a8dc",
                                        "entry_id": "ccd67228-325c-304e-80b6-0187c9512dac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used at the end of a question for emphasis, or to direct the conversation to something of more broad importance (compare with more to the point)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "651cd099-071c-4858-bc65-79c5729bd100",
                                                "sense_id": "5c6fa63c-7c76-35a8-abad-644040b4a8dc",
                                                "text": "“But I say, Kid, isn't that going it a little too strong? Whisky and alcohol's bad enough; but when it comes to brandy and pepper-sauce and—” ¶ “Dump it in. Who's making this punch, anyway?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b0ee069-380b-4d13-bdbd-6e5817fc9b71",
                                                "sense_id": "5c6fa63c-7c76-35a8-abad-644040b4a8dc",
                                                "text": "The name, Barry Frank, the name of the game when it comes to money these days, in every sport, is television revenue. How do they get enough money- let me back up a minute. How did the United States get the World Cup anyway? Of all the countries in the world, you'd think we'd be the last one to get it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c61dbab8-c44b-4b62-ad1c-ced5b99ad7c5",
                                                "sense_id": "5c6fa63c-7c76-35a8-abad-644040b4a8dc",
                                                "text": "“We should probably wait until Luke gets here to talk about it,” Leia suggested quietly before Han could answer. Lando glanced past Han, as if only just noticing Luke's absence. “Where is he, anyway?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba4e186f-cc78-3bba-8668-19f467c702bc",
                                        "entry_id": "ccd67228-325c-304e-80b6-0187c9512dac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In any way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eef9dd90-d944-40d4-87e1-696337e7574e",
                                                "sense_id": "ba4e186f-cc78-3bba-8668-19f467c702bc",
                                                "text": "He that sleeps in the day-time, or is in suspense, fear, anyway troubled in mind, or goes to bed upon a full stomach, may never hope for quiet rest in the night […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a69b381-099b-4af6-bb9a-913d6900c2e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9aad0a0-8f58-3fed-805b-d49f79382f56",
                        "source_sense_description": "так или иначе",
                        "target_lang_word": "somehow",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "somehow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                        "entry_id": "448fe6cd-6495-3885-b703-2a6cb503bdb1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In one way or another; in a way not yet known or explained; by some means"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa0d352b-fc72-42c6-90e6-e8f3501ecdc5",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "This problem has to be tackled somehow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8fc5827-9888-44ef-83f9-b1340df02b9d",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "We don't know how he's still alive after the accident, but somehow he is."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "992fb67a-8ef6-4beb-a78a-6be18e16561c",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "December 1, 2016, Tom Donaghy writing in The New York Times, Tender Side of Edward Albee\nIt’s not by accident Edward wrote “The Goat,” “The Zoo Story” or “Seascape,” with its two lizards, Sarah and Leslie. In fact, in all of his plays the animal is pretty prominent, somehow or other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6b4a762-3f1a-414c-95d3-c517067adcde",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "Carried somehow, somewhither, for some reason, on these surging floods, were these travelers, of errand not wholly obvious to their fellows, yet of such sort as to call into query alike the nature of their errand and their own relations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24029f4c-0e28-435d-8548-359cabb7776b",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "Have I not loathed to live again and said\nIt would have been far better to be dead,\n And yet somehow, I know not why,\nRemained afraid to die!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4254fed-dfb7-46a8-adb2-034937886b68",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "Although youngest of the family, he has somehow or other got the entire management of all the others."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
